  "ruleText": "CHAPTER Ins 6200 ANCILLARY HEALTH MINIMUM STANDARDS\n\nStatutory Authority: RSA 400-A:15, I; RSA 415:6, VII; RSA 415:18, I; RSA 415-A:2; and RSA 415-A:3, I\n\nREVISION NOTE #1:\n\nDocument #12600, effective 8-3-18, adopted Chapter Ins 6200 titled “Ancillary Health Minimum Standards” containing Part Ins 6201 titled “Ancillary Health Minimum Standards General Provisions.”",
